{"kind":"finding","id":"F-ledger-career-003-01","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/LedgerOrchestratorTests.cs","line":146,"method":"OnRecordingCommitted_AddsActionsToLedger","category":"T2","severity":"Low","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/GameActions/LedgerOrchestrator.cs:301; delete the OnRecordingCommitted body -> this test and its twin stay green; only removing Ledger.AddAction (Ledger.cs:137) reds it","what_it_asserts":"After Ledger.AddAction(action), Ledger.Actions holds one row carrying the supplied RecordingId and Type.","why_weak":"The method named in the test is never called (the inline-add comment at line 148 admits it); LedgerTests.AddAction_AppendsToList pins the same append with a stronger Assert.Same, and a regression in OnRecordingCommitted's Ledger.AddActions call (line 383) leaves this cell green.","proposed_action":"Delete as a strict subset of LedgerTests.AddAction_AppendsToList; commit-ingestion coverage is carried by OnRecordingCommitted_BatchOriginWentStaleMidBatch... at line 3293.","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"F-ledger-career-003-02","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/LedgerOrchestratorTests.cs","line":171,"method":"OnRecordingCommitted_LogsSummary","category":"T3","severity":"Medium","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/GameActions/LedgerOrchestrator.cs:2518; delete the recalculate completion log -> red, but the OnRecordingCommitted summary at :398 that the name claims is never exercised","what_it_asserts":"A RecalculateAndPatch walk over a one-action ledger logs 'RecalculateAndPatch complete'.","why_weak":"The name and the class comment (line 149) claim the OnRecordingCommitted commit-summary path, which the test never calls; the asserted line is already pinned by RecalculateAndPatch_RunsWithoutError (line 198, with the added '0 actions' token). Sibling cells in the same file call OnRecordingCommitted for real (line 3309), so the stated blocker is stale.","proposed_action":"Delete (redundant) or drive the real OnRecordingCommitted with a recording fixture and assert 'Committed recording ... actions added to ledger' (LedgerOrchestrator.cs:398).","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"F-ledger-career-003-03","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/LedgerOrchestratorTests.cs","line":113,"method":"ResetForTesting_ClearsState","category":"T3","severity":"Low","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/GameActions/LedgerOrchestrator.cs:6557-6563; drop the contractsModule/strategiesModule/kerbalsModule null assignments -> green, because only 6 of the 9 module accessors are asserted null (lines 121-126)","what_it_asserts":"After ResetForTesting, IsInitialized=false, six module accessors are null, and Ledger.Actions is empty.","why_weak":"ResetForTesting nulls nine module fields (lines 6555-6563) but the cell checks six, so a partial reset that leaves Contracts, Strategies or Kerbals stale across tests stays green (SupersedeCommitTombstoneTests:686 only incidentally pins Kerbals).","proposed_action":"Add Assert.Null for Contracts, Strategies and Kerbals (and optionally OnTimelineDataChanged) so the reset contract is pinned for every field the reset clears.","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
